{"text": "The father was very happy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To see them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the woman was angry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon there was even less food. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The woman locked the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So Hansel could not get pebbles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel dropped bread crumbs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the path instead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the birds of the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ate every crumb. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children could not find. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The way home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They walked for three days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And grew weaker and weaker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then a pretty white bird sang. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they followed it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It led them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To a little house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Made of bread and cake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The windows were made. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of clear sugar. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel ate a piece of the roof. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And Gretel nibbled at a window.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "n", "g", "r", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "